
(7 taukehe?) pono: { Huaputa tuhi: ['7 is an ODD NUMBER'], rārangi-hou. }, ki-te-kore: { Huaputa tuhi: ['WRONG!']. }.
(4 taurua?) pono: { Huaputa tuhi: ['4 is an EVEN NUMBER'], rārangi-hou. }, ki-te-kore: { Huaputa tuhi: ['WRONG!']. }.
(5 taurua?) pono: { Huaputa tuhi: ['WRONG!']. }, ki-te-kore: { Huaputa tuhi: ['5 is NOT AN EVEN NUMBER'], rārangi-hou. }.
(6 taukehe?) pono: { Huaputa tuhi: ['WRONG!']. }, ki-te-kore: { Huaputa tuhi: ['6 is NOT AN ODD NUMBER'], rārangi-hou. }.
